# Everything under $DSH_HOME is runtime-generated by dsh on first use
# (profiles/<name>/, settings.yaml, .credentials.yaml, session data, …).
# Track only the config we author here:
#   - cordis.patch.yml   (this repo's home-level patch, read on every boot)
# Un-ignore any other file you want to ship/version.
*
!/.gitignore
!/.gitkeep
!/cordis.patch.yml